ased Wireless Rover using Arduino Uno & LoRa Module. A DHT Sensor and Gas Sensor to monitor the environment GY-68 sensor along with an Ultrasonic Sensor is used to control the rover. The rover measures the mine environment parameters like Temperature, Humidity, Pressure, Gas Levels & Terrain. These parameters are critical to the design, and comprehensive analysis of these parameters ensures planning and safety of the surface and underground mining activities.","topics":[],"score":2247,"global_rank":166899},{"name":"chaitanyakrishna1248/IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","owner":"chaitanyakrishna1248","html_url":"https://github.com/chaitanyakrishna1248/IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","topics":[],"score":2247,"global_rank":166900},{"name":"lilyblack31/Computer-Graphics-and-Multimedia-Lab","owner":"lilyblack31","html_url":"https://github.com/lilyblack31/Computer-Graphics-and-Multimedia-Lab","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Experiments done during the laboratory hours of Computer Graphics and Multimedia lab (IT7711)","topics":[],"score":2247,"global_rank":166967},{"name":"luisnaranjo733/rnw-64-bundle-bug-repro","owner":"luisnaranjo733","html_url":"https://github.com/luisnaranjo733/rnw-64-bundle-bug-repro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Repro of an issue I'm experiencing with RNW 0.64.18","topics":[],"score":2247,"global_rank":167047},{"name":"lucasrumney94/cpp-courses-notes","owner":"lucasrumney94","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasrumney94/cpp-courses-notes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"A collection of annotated examples and notes to demonstrate learnings from C++ Courses. ","topics":[],"score":2247,"global_rank":167048},{"name":"Geeoon/KaprekarConstant","owner":"Geeoon","html_url":"https:/